{"sourceUrl":"https://cs.hit.edu.cn/2026/0605/c11271a393612/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:54.520893+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://cs.hit.edu.cn/2026/0605/c11271a393612/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>为促进优秀大学生</span><span>之间</span><span>的学术交流，</span><span>增进外校</span><span>学生对哈尔滨工业大学</span><span>计算学部</span><span>的了解，</span><span>学部特</span><span><span>举办</span><span>202</span></span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>学术交流营活动</span><span>，</span><span>现将有关事宜</span><span>通知如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、申请资格</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1、 </span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，身心健康、诚实守信，学风端正</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>2、 </span><span>2027届高水平研究型大学优秀本科生</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>3、 </span><span>有志于从事计算机科学与技术、软件工程、网络空间安全、智能科学与技术、电子信息等</span><span>专业研究</span><span>，并具有较强研究能力的理工科</span><span>报名者</span><span>优先考虑；</span></p><p><span>4、 </span><span>英语水平</span><span>优良</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、申请流程</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1、申请形式：</span></p><p><span>填写报名信息</span><span>（</span><span>问卷网址：</span><span>https://mu73uoeeufm004my.mikecrm.com/yPOi5xR）</span></p><p><span>报名时间</span><span><span>：</span><span>2026年6月5日至6月22日。</span></span></p><p><span>2、申请材料：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）个人简历、学生证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩排名证明扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4）体现英语水平的证明材料</span></span><span>扫描件</span><span><span>（国家英语四六级，</span><span>TOEFL成绩，GRE成绩等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>5）其他</span></span><span>成果</span><span>材料，包括：已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页扫描件；本科期间各类获奖证书扫描件。</span></p><p><span><span>请申请人将以上材料合成一个</span><span>PDF文件</span></span><span><span>后上传系统（</span><span>10M以内），</span></span><span><span>文件命名为</span><span>“</span></span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>+考生姓名”</span><span>，</span><span>在填写报名信息时一并上传</span><span>。相关</span><span>材料</span><span>原件请准备好，入营时备查。</span></p><p><span>3、</span><span>营员选拔</span></p><p><span><span>学部将根据申请者提供的信息及材料，择优确定入营人选，入营名单将于</span><span>6月26日前通过邮件或短信的形式通知申请者。届时未入选者，恕不另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>三、</span><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1、 </span><span>学术交流营举办时间：</span><span>2026年7月中旬前后择机举办</span><span><span>，预计</span><span>2-3天，具体时间另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span>2、 </span><span><span>学术交流营举办地点：哈尔滨市南岗区西大直街</span><span>92号哈尔滨工业大学一校区。</span></span></p><p><span>3、 </span><span>活动内容：</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1）开营式；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2）专家学术报告；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>3）参观学习、学术交流；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>4）其他活动。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>四、其他说明</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1、 </span><span>学部将为营员提供在营期间的食宿资助。</span></p><p><span>2、 </span><span>营员报到后须全程参加学术交流营的活动。</span></p><p><span>3、 </span><span>具体日程会根据实际情况进行调整。</span></p><p><span>4、 </span><span>具体政策以学校当年的文件为准。</span></p><p><strong><span>五、联系方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>谢</span><span>老师</span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>0451-86403711</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>                                             </span><span>哈尔滨工业大学计算学部</span></p><p><span>                                              </span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>6</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e7055b25d2c15977e3af35a43f4d197370d744f4d0113024f489ee38a76bc9ab","textLength":881,"sourceSha256":"0efb367cc86192ac5d3fca5e31b9f2cbcee338aa3e5a04a6517d111e8e963049","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d16445e429b6d938574c","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学计算学部关于举办2026年学术交流营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:54.520893+00:00"}
